{title: Give God the glory}

{comment: Chorus}
Give God the glory, Give God the glory
Give God the glory,
He will give you and He will give you
And He will give you the Victory

{comment: Bridge}
Satan the blood of Jesus is against you
Satan the blood of Jesus is against you
Satan the blood of Jesus is against you
So let us give God, So let us give God
So let us give God all of the praise
